  <!-- EN: A carefully refined zopioid known for its medical uses, dreamsticks, as they are known on the Rim, are a combat pain reliever prized by soldiers and doctors alike.  By using a specially designed, one-use auto-injector, the drug can be safely and quickly injected to relieve pain quickly and relatively safely.  Useful for keeping a soldier in combat longer or helping get one to safety.  Be warned however, once it wears off the pain comes back stronger for a short time. -->
  <RC2_Dreamstick.description>“梦杖”是一种经过精心提纯的佐皮奥类药物，以其医疗用途而闻名，在边疆地区广受士兵和医生推崇，是战斗中的止痛良药。通过使用专门设计的一次性自动注射器，可安全、快速地注射该药物，从而迅速且相对安全地缓解疼痛。  它有助于让士兵在战场上坚持更久，或协助其撤离至安全地带。但需注意，药效一过，疼痛会在短时间内以更强烈的形式卷土重来。</RC2_Dreamstick.description>
